OL,3,ADallas Cowboys Cheerleaders star
OL,4,Aovercomes stunt casting criticism
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Dallas Cowboys Cheerleader Reece
OL,7,FWeaver has shelved her cowboy boots and
OL,8,Fswapped the football pitch for the
OL,9,Fstage as she steps into one of the most
OL,10,Ffamous roles in the world.
OL,12,FWeaver was a breakout star of the
OL,13,FNetflix docuseries America's
OL,14,FSweethearts: Dallas Cowboys
OL,15,FCheerleaders, with her exit from the
OL,16,Fsquad a major storyline of the third
OL,17,Fseason.
OL,19,FMaking her Broadway debut in the
OL,20,Fmusical Chicago, she faced criticism
OL,21,Fthat it was her profile, more than her
OL,22,Ftalent, which landed her the role.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
